<!-- Start About Area  -->
<div class="rbt-about-area about-style-1 bg-color-white rbt-section-gapTop about-page">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="thumbnail-wrapper">
                    <div class="thumbnail image-1">
                        <img data-parallax='{"x": 0, "y": -20}' src="~/assets/images/about/about-explore.svg" alt="Search and compare courses on CoursesHub">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail image-2 d-none d-xl-block">
                        <img data-parallax='{"x": 0, "y": 60}' src="~/assets/images/about/about-apply.svg" alt="Simple course application checklist">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail image-3 d-none d-md-block">
                        <img data-parallax='{"x": 0, "y": 80}' src="~/assets/images/about/about-guidance.svg" alt="CoursesHub advisor helping a learner choose a course">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="inner pl--50 pl_sm--0 pl_md--0">
                    <div class="section-title text-start">
                        <span class="subtitle bg-coral-opacity">Know About Us</span>
                        <h2 class="title">Know About CoursesHub </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="description mt--30">
                        At CoursesHub, we aim to make your Training Provider journey smoother and more accessible. Whether you're looking to start your undergraduate degree, pursue a postgraduate qualification, or explore new academic fields, CoursesHub connects you with top universities across Australia, providing a streamlined platform to apply and enroll in university courses.
                        We understand that the process of choosing the right course and applying to a Training Provider can be overwhelming, and that’s where we come in. Our goal is to simplify your higher education experience by offering a user-friendly platform where you can easily explore, compare, and enroll in courses that align with your interests and career aspirations.
                    </p>
                    <!-- Start Feature List  -->
                    <div class="rbt-feature-wrapper mt--40">

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-pink-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-list"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Comprehensive Training Provider Listings</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">
                                    We partner with a wide range of reputable Australian Training Providers, ensuring you have access to a variety of courses across numerous disciplines – from business and engineering to healthcare and arts..
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-primary-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-check-circle"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Easy Application Process</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">Applying to university can be a daunting process, but with CoursesHub, you can apply directly to your chosen programs with ease. We provide clear instructions and support throughout the entire application process, making it easier for you to get started.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-coral-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-compass"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Expert Guidance</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">Not sure which course or Training Provider is right for you? Our team is here to help! We provide information and advice on various academic pathways, entry requirements, scholarships, and more, to help you make an informed decision.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-coral-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-refresh-cw"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Up-to-Date Course Information</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">Stay informed with the latest course offerings, program updates, and important deadlines. We ensure that all the information you need is current, so you never miss an opportunity.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-coral-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-life-buoy"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Support Every Step of the Way</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">From pre-enrollment to graduation, we’re here to support your academic journey. Whether you have questions about the application process, need advice on student visas, or are looking for financial aid, CoursesHub is your trusted partner.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>


                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- End About Area  -->
<!-- Start Button Area  -->
<div class="rbt-video-area rbt-section-gapBottom pt--50 bg-color-white about-page about-mission">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 order-2 order-lg-1">
                <div class="inner pr--50">
                    <div class="section-title text-start">
                        <h2 class="title">Our Mission</h2>
                        <p class="description mt--30">
                            CoursesHub is dedicated to making higher education more accessible to students from all walks of life. We aim to provide an easy and efficient way for students to explore Training Provider options and take the first step toward achieving their academic and career goals.
                        </p>
                        <p class="description mt--30">
                            Whether you're looking to pursue a traditional degree, an online program, or a specialized course, CoursesHub helps you find the right fit and guides you through the application process – all in one place.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-2">
                <div class="video-popup-wrapper">
                    <img class="w-100 rbt-radius" src="~/assets/images/others/about-mission.svg" alt="CoursesHub mission">
                    <a class="popup-video position-to-top" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nA1Aqp0sPQo">
                        <span><img src="~/assets/images/icons/youtube.png" alt=""></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- End Button Area  -->


<div class="rbt-about-area about-style-1 bg-color-white rbt-section-gapTop about-page about-values">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="thumbnail-wrapper">
                    <div class="thumbnail image-1">
                        <img data-parallax='{"x": 0, "y": -20}' src="~/assets/images/about/about-graduate.svg" alt="Graduate celebrating their achievement">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail image-2 d-none d-xl-block">
                        <img data-parallax='{"x": 0, "y": 60}' src="~/assets/images/about/about-integrity.svg" alt="Accredited and reputable training providers">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail image-3 d-none d-md-block">
                        <img data-parallax='{"x": 0, "y": 80}' src="~/assets/images/about/about-excellence.svg" alt="Learner growth and excellence">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="inner pl--50 pl_sm--0 pl_md--0">
                    <div class="section-title text-start">
                        <h2 class="title">Our Values:</h2>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Start Feature List  -->
                    <div class="rbt-feature-wrapper mt--40">

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-pink-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-unlock"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Accessibility</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">
                                    We believe that education should be accessible to everyone. Our platform is designed to make the application process as easy as possible, with clear information and simplified steps.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-primary-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-shield"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Integrity</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">We work closely with accredited universities to ensure that all the programs listed on our platform are reputable and align with industry standards.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-coral-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-award"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Excellence</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">We are committed to providing high-quality resources, tools, and support to help you succeed in your Training Provider application and beyond.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rbt-feature feature-style-1">
                            <div class="icon bg-coral-opacity">
                                <i class="feather-trending-up"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-content">
                                <h6 class="feature-title">Empowerment</h6>
                                <p class="feature-description">By offering a range of Training Provider courses, we empower students to take control of their educational journey and make informed choices about their future.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>



                    </div>


                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="about-page about-cta">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-cta-inner">
            <h1 class="title">Start your journey to Training Provider with CoursesHub today – your future begins here!</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
@section scripts{
    <script src="@CoursesHub.AssetVersion.Url("~/assets/js/main.js")"></script>
}